<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Shield Academy Matrix</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0f19;
            --card-bg: #111827;
            --primary-neon: #00ffcc;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border-color: #1f2937;
            --danger-neon: #ff3333;
            --accent-glow: rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.15);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* 🌐 NAVBAR MENU */
        header {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .navbar {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-neon);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-menu a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-menu a:hover, .nav-menu a.active {
            color: var(--primary-neon);
        }

        .user-profile {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .logout-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--danger-neon);
            color: var(--danger-neon);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .logout-btn:hover {
            background: var(--danger-neon);
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* 🎯 CREATIVE MAIN CONTENT */
        main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            flex: 1;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        /* 🚀 HERO SECTION WITH DYNAMIC GRAPHICS BACKDROP */
        .about-hero {
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135px, #111827 0%, #070a13 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .about-hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 60%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, var(--primary-neon));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* 🎚️ IMAGE INTEGRATION GRID DISPLAY */
        .showcase-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .showcase-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .showcase-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .showcase-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .showcase-image-wrapper:hover .showcase-image {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .showcase-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(11,15,25,0.9) 10%, transparent 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .showcase-text h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: var(--primary-neon);
        }

        .showcase-text p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ⚡ INTERACTIVE HOVER CARD BLOCKS */
        .features-matrix {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .feature-node {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-node:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--primary-neon);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.1);
        }

        .icon-box {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--primary-neon);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .feature-node h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .feature-node p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* 🛑 FOOTER */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        @keyframes cyberPulse {
            0% { text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.2); transform: scale(1); }
            50% { text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--primary-neon); transform: scale(1.02); }
            100% { text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 255, 204, 0.2); transform: scale(1); }
        }

        .logo-animated {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            animation: cyberPulse 3s infinite ease-in-out;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="navbar">
            <div class="logo logo-animated">🛡️ Shield Academy</div>
            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/courses">Courses</a></li>
                <li><a href="/dashboard">My Dashboard</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>
                
                <% if (user && user.role === 'admin') { %>
                    <li>
                        <a href="/admin/dashboard" style="border: 1px solid #ff3366; color: #ff3366; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;">
                            Admin Panel
                        </a>
                    </li>
                <% } %>
            </ul>
            <div class="user-profile">
                <span>Welcome, <b style="color: var(--primary-neon);"><%= user.name %></b></span>
                <a href="/logout" class="logout-btn">Logout</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        
        <div class="about-hero">
            <h1>DECODING CYBER LAB INFRASTRUCTURE</h1>
            <p>Shield Academy provides an advanced ecosystem for next-generation security engineers. We specialize in dynamic automation setups, deep-penetration testing arrays, and threat analytics monitoring nodes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-grid">
            <div class="showcase-image-wrapper">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526374965328-7f61d4dc18c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" class="showcase-image" alt="Cyber security lab architecture">
                <div class="showcase-overlay">
                    <div class="showcase-text">
                        <h2>Advanced Research Cell</h2>
                        <p>Our virtual sandbox terminals are configured to deploy deep analysis framework execution instantly with zero asset disruption.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="showcase-image-wrapper">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" class="showcase-image" alt="Server clusters computing hardware">
                <div class="showcase-overlay">
                    <div class="showcase-text">
                        <h2>Infrastructure Defense</h2>
                        <p>We train engineers to architect impenetrable security matrices across hybrid cloud systems using strict hardening protocols.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="features-matrix">
            <div class="feature-node">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
                <h3>Elite Training Core</h3>
                <p>Curated learning materials engineered precisely from scratch to help navigate active digital threats effortlessly.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-node">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i></div>
                <h3>Dynamic Webhooks</h3>
                <p>Integrated pipeline protocols sync your enrollment status safely using automated transactional dispatch pipelines.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-node">
                <div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear"></i></div>
                <h3>Secured Console Nodes</h3>
                <p>Strict structural backend access filters guarantee that data analytics parameters remain fully optimized and authorized.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Shield Academy Enterprise. Zero-Cost Infrastructure Integration.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>